WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.200
Are they moving Yuzu-senpai over to the high school?

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:20.540
Rola said she was shipping her belongings off this week too.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:24.040
It's the start of another new year.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.130
Good! Good!

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:29.050
Good! And stop!

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.170
Wh-What is all this?!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:37.800
It's Haruka's luggage!

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.810
Coming, coming!

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.680
A-And what is <i>this</i> supposed to be?

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:45.060
This totem pole is a moving-in gift!

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.110
It's for you, Ako-chan!

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:48.980
I-I'm flattered...

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.190
You heard her! Take it to Ako-nyan's room please, please!

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.610
Hold it!

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:57.070
Keep that in your own room!

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.370
It looks like the new S4 is going to be just as fun and exciting as the last.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:03.040
I fear for the future...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.000
By the way, where's Yume?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.960
She left for work early this morning.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:10.130
We should head over to help Rola pack—

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.460
What was that?

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.590
Yume?!

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.050
What's going on?

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.760
Sorry, there's no time to explain!

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.360
Rola too?

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:30.360
Are you okay?

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.490
Sorry, but I'm in a hurry! We'll talk later!

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.320
What's gotten into them?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:15.670
Here you go.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:19.170
I gathered the files you'll need for your new admin positions.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.380
Look at it all!

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:25.430
And it's so detailed! When did you make these?

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:30.770
With Yuri-senpai and Lily-senpai graduating, I should've stayed here to help you out.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.230
I'm really sorry!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:39.150
I know it's a lot to ask, but please support Song Class and Yume as her new admins.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.400
Rola...

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.660
Of course we will! You can count on us.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:46.870
Thanks! You're the best.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:53.040
Here's the research you requested regarding venues in England.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:55.250
Thanks, this is a huge help.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.090
Is that for Sakuraba?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:04:03.930
Yes. I know Rola's busy preparing to move, 
so I wanted to do everything I could to help out.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:05.720
Also...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:10.850
I'm confident that Spice Chord will find a dedicated audience overseas too.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:14.270
To allow Rola to continue on as a muse in England,

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.980
please give her your full support with Four Star Academy's resources.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.690
Of course, we will.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:27.070
Those two are birds of a feather.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.330
Meaning?

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:33.790
Nijino is running around using her gaps of free time to help Sakuraba.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:39.460
Sakuraba fills up every minute of her day with admin meetings for Nijino.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:45.260
And to think they were late their 
very first day and collapsed on stage.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:47.430
They've gone through so much.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.560
And matured through every experience.

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:55.060
Finally back...

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.230
Am I gonna make it?

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.770
You exasperate me!

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:04.780
A normal person would prioritize packing before all else!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.410
Oh, let her be.

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.950
We'll lend you a hand, Rola!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:11.540
Thanks, you're lifesavers.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.120
Where should we start?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.040
I haven't done anything yet, so wherever's fine.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.750
Rola!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.750
Yume?!

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:26.800
I brought you resources on England and English textbooks.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.810
Also, a year's supply of high-quality domestic konbu! {not sukonbu?}

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.220
Thank goodness I made it!

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.270
You prepared all this?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.140
Sorry I'm late.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.610
Thanks, Yume.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:44.570
That's my line! Thank you for getting the new admins up to speed for next year.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:48.070
Honestly, the two of you can't think of anyone but each other.

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:50.030
Come on, time's a-wasting.{everything looks weird but this seems most less bad}

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:52.160
Let's all pack together!

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.830
Yeah!

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:04.460
We're done!

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.100
It feels like everything's wrapped up. {going for the double meaning here}

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.260
Yeah.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.730
Rola, did you forget anything?

00:06:21.730 --> 00:06:22.820
Rola?

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.280
Something you forgot?

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:31.700
Yeah... I know I'm leaving soon, 
but it feels like I'm missing something.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:36.700
Like I've forgotten something important, and it's tugging at me...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.370
I feel the same way!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:38.960
Huh?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:42.420
I've been feeling like something's missing for a while now.

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.630
You too?

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:48.720
That's no good. How are you supposed to make a clean start to the new year?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.090
You'll be stuck with one foot in the past.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.560
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:04.980
<i>When a page is flipped, another new story should begin.</i>

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.070
<i>So why is it...</i>

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.360
<i>...that I can't get excited?</i>

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.740
What're you doing all the way out here?

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:14.120
Subaru-kun?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.540
Out here?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.210
When did I get here?!

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:22.120
I'm amazed you still manage to get lost.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.090
I-I'll leave right away!

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:25.800
Hold on!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:29.970
I'm glad you're here. There's something I've been meaning to say.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.590
There is?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:36.260
Congratulations on winning the Aikatsu Ranking 
and on keeping your spot in S4.

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.390
Thank you!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.060
And also... to say goodbye.

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.520
Huh? Why?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:44.940
No, it's not like we'll never meet again...

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:47.690
It's just a matter of my feelings.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:49.240
Your feelings?

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:54.870
Seeing you on stage made me want to go and put myself out there in the world.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:59.660
Like... I want to be an idol who can stand next to you.{this is more fun}

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.290
So I'm going to focus on my Aikatsu until then.

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.210
Got it! We're rivals, after all! {nooo}

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.420
Rivals?!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.920
Huh?! Or not?

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.510
I just meant since we're both idols, um...

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.470
I know how hard you're working, so I want to match—

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.180
That hurts!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:22.060
We'll continue this after I become the world's top idol.

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:23.520
Geez!

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.730
See you then, Nijino Yume.

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:37.370
A matter of feelings...

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.620
Busted!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:44.040
That looked suspiciously like a confession.{a) this is "was that like a confession" and b) what do you think about using the word confess(ion)}{it's not "was it like a" and more "that was basically a confession"}

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.960
Looks like you got shot down pretty hard.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.210
You guys...

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.550
Ah, to be young...

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:55.130
Stop that!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:59.010
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:00.430
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.850
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.690
Is it still picking at you?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.730
Yeah, I'm kinda stuck.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.320
So, hey—

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.320
So, hey—

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:12.150
Yeah?

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:16.990
Um, I was just going to ask if you wanted to think about what we're forgetting, or something...

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:19.530
I was going to ask you the same thing!

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:23.700
Here we go!

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:25.710
Aikatsu!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:34.340
This is where you said we were true rivals after our center competition.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.550
I didn't really understand back then,

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:39.010
but now I do.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:42.350
You're the best rival I could've asked for.

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:48.690
And this is where you opened up to me about that strange power.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:53.440
It sounded like it was a huge roadblock, 
but you managed to get over it by yourself.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.450
You really are incredible.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:59.280
That's not true. I didn't do it by myself.

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:03.200
What you said to me back then gave me strength,

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.660
and Hime-senpai guided me too.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:10.420
I haven't been able to do anything for her in return.

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.500
Isn't that it?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.840
What you've forgotten.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:17.380
Don't you want to do something for Hime-senpai?

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.300
Yeah...

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:21.640
But what exactly should I do?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:23.260
How do you feel? {this doesn't really read that good}{is this better}

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.180
What do you want to do?

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:29.100
Aren't your feelings what matter most?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:31.650
What I want...

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:36.280
After I lost to Hime-senpai last year, this is where I cried my eyes out.

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:44.580
I swore that I'd beat her next time.

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:47.500
I want to fulfill that vow.

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.160
That's right.

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:52.330
You made that vow, Yume-chan.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:53.670
Hime-senpai?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:57.590
I remember it every time I come here.

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:06.930
I want to compete with you on stage one more time.

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:10.730
It's... a matter of my feelings.

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:18.150
Ever since last year's S4 Selection, I've experienced a lot of things and grown just as much.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:20.780
So this time, I won't lose!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.120
Me too.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:30.750
After I saw Elza-chan perform last year, I did Aikatsu around the world in search of what I was missing.

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:34.290
And on my journey, I found the answer.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:39.090
I accept, Yume-chan. Let's face off on stage once more.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.340
With neither of us holding anything back.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:44.050
Okay!

00:11:55.940 --> 00:12:02.150
Welcome to Four Star Academy's 
Shiratori Hime vs. Nijino Yume exhibition stage.{this entire line makes me uncomfort}

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.700
We're happy to see you here!

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.330
The performance will begin momentarily.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.540
It appears that they will take the stage together, and fan votes will decide the result.

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.130
I can't contain my excitement!{is this important}{zo}

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.210
I made it!

00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:23.380
Aria-chan? Why are you here?

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:27.930
Hime-chan told me about this, and I just couldn't sit still.

00:12:27.930 --> 00:12:31.140
I got dropped off at the harbor and ran straight here!{I'm assuming there was a car or something involved}{she's breathing heavily}

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.810
Who do you think'll win?

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:35.900
Either way, it'll be intriguing.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:39.860
<i>I see you intend to play your trump card at last,</i>

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.440
<i>Hime Shiratori.</i>

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:43.860
This is it.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.990
I'm glad I got to help with one last performance before flying out.{or leaving, or taking off, autc}

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:50.830
Thanks, Rola.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:54.420
You know what? I can't contain my excitement right now!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.840
My Aikatsu was inspired by Hime-senpai.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.460
I've always wanted to surpass her.

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:03.920
I'm so glad I was able to remember that feeling.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:06.970
It's your turn next.

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:12.850
Once you see my greatest performance, I'm sure you'll get excited.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:17.600
And hopefully that'll help you remember what you forgot.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.020
I believe you. Don't disappoint!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.730
Here we go, Yume!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:22.740
Right!

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.940
Together!

00:13:23.940 --> 00:13:26.660
Aikatsu!

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.790
<i>The Eternal Rainbow Coord.</i>

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:45.260
<i>This dress is an amalgamation of the time I spent shining together with Elza-san and the others.{I kinda want to use "mosaic" instead of "amalgamation"}{I can only think of the censorship mosaic}</i>

00:13:47.590 --> 00:13:50.510
<i>The Moon Dress, emitting an everlasting glimmer.</i>

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:56.560
<i>My Eternal Princess Coord, holding true strength and refined beauty within it.</i>

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:01.070
<i>Its golden shining wings will take me to the future.</i>

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.280
Yume-chan, are you prepared?

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:06.280
Yes!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:07.990
Shiratori Hime!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.700
Nijino Yume!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.660
Ready to go!

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.660
Ready to go!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.850
This miraculous glimmer is for you!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:47.440
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.620
Such a gorgeous dress...

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.250
What is that?

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.830
It must be...

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.370
The Moon Dress!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:48.920
A miraculous dress rivaling the Sun Dress that only the chosen ones may wear!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:52.130
Hime-chan's awesome!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.050
The Sun and Moon... {I figure this is fine}{I should play one of them before I die probably}

00:15:56.140 --> 00:15:58.720
Hime-senpai, your dress...

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.810
It's the Moon Dress.

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:02.850
Did I surprise you?

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.940
You really are incredible!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.150
This is it. Ready?

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.690
Yes!

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:06.850
It's time to announce the results.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:10.520
Whoever lit up the stage the most will be crowned the victor.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.110
That person is...

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:21.120
Nijino Yume!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.540
Congratulations, Yume-chan!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.790
You were positively brilliant!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.250
Hime-senpai!

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.800
You were right, Yume.

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:44.220
This excitement reminded me of what I forgot.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:48.850
You really... really get me going!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:57.900
Hime-senpai.

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:00.160
Your dress...

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.820
Yes, it's the answer I found.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:10.250
Just as you earned the Sun Dress through meeting Elza-chan and experiencing many different things,

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:17.170
I arrived at this dress through meeting Aria-chan and overcoming the obstacles in my way.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:21.840
The world was full of Aikatsu I never could've imagined.

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:26.680
I'd love to hear more about your journey and the Aikatsu you did.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.940
Yume-chan! Hime-chan!

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.610
Let's enjoy a long chat about it afterwards.

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:36.730
Aren't you keeping someone dear to you waiting?

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.320
Yume-chan, Hime-chan!

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.120
I love you!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:45.990
I love you so much...

00:19:45.990 --> 00:19:48.620
Some day, I hope the three of us can...

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:52.120
Aria-chan, dry those tears.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:55.880
Thank you, Aria-chan.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.960
<i>Huh? Where's Rola?</i>

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.130
It's from Elza-san...

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.800
Put Hime Shiratori on.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.220
Elza-chan! What's up?

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:12.890
If the Sun and Moon join forces, 
they'll be unstoppable. Form a unit with me.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.730
That sounds like it may be fun as well.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.570
I'll consider it.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:21.990
The Moon Dress... One day, for sure...

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.660
I will plunder it!

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.620
Elza-sama looks so happy!

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.090
There she is!

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.340
Rola!

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.210
I found it.

00:20:41.130 --> 00:20:42.510
What I forgot.

00:20:43.970 --> 00:20:46.890
I had forgotten to tell you my feelings.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:52.980
Congrats, Yume!

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:56.440
Your performance was the best!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.650
Without question, you're the first star!

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.320
But!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:05.450
I'm going to win next time!

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.700
Because my inspiration...

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:11.080
...is you.{I will continue do this}

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.870
There's no way I could've made it this far on my own.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.590
It was only because you were next to me, never stopping,

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:25.760
that no matter how much it hurt, I could muster the will to try again, to win the struggle against myself.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:33.890
Now that the person I've always wanted to surpass has become number one, I can't contain my excitement.

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:38.940
I'll become so much better that you won't recognize me by the time I get back.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.940
The future me...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:44.740
...definitely won't lose!{I think I do this every time we have a line like this, do you change them back? (also I changed the timing to push it up against the previous line since I thought it looked awkward}

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.620
I'm not gonna give you a second to rest, got it?

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.240
Yeah, neither will I!

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:57.960
Ow!

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.260
I feel relieved!

00:22:03.260 --> 00:22:06.880
I can finally step up to my new start line.

00:22:06.880 --> 00:22:09.430
The next competition will be between you and me.

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.390
It's a promise, Rola.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:14.600
With neither of us holding anything back!

00:23:55.870 --> 00:24:02.000
I started my Aikatsu, grew alongside my friends, and got to wear the Star Wings and Sun Dress.{is it just me or is the volume for this part too loud}

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.670
And I was able to get the Moon Dress.

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.420
The world is still full of much more Aikatsu.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:09.170
I can't contain my excitement!

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.300
So much has happened to us these last two years.

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:16.350
Our Aikatsu will continue into the future.

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.600
This isn't goodbye.

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.680
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.680 --> 00:24:21.890
To An Uncharted Future.

00:24:21.890 --> 00:24:24.440
Become the first-star idol!
